<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>place round:</i> in this sense only poet. in 
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίσταμαι,</span> with intr. aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφέστην,</span>
			
				Ep.
			
			3pl.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφέσταν,</span> and
				3pl.
			pf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφεστᾶσι,</span>
			<i>stand around,</i> abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλοι δ᾽ ἀμφέσταν ἑταῖροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.233
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλαίων δ᾽ ἀμφίσταθ᾽ ὅμιλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.712
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δέ σ᾽ ἔστησαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.58
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδίον ἀμφεστᾶσι πᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1312
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aj.</u>
				724
			</span></i>: c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίσταμαι τραπέζαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>El.</u>
					192
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>investigate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tab.Heracl.
				1.125
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπιστατήρ.</span></div>
